Title: Hibernian: Thibault Klidje joins for record fee
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'David Gray', 'Text': 'Klidje will add "extra pace and trickery" to Hibs\' front line.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 29, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Speaker': 'Gray', 'Text': '"He adds extra pace and trickery to our front line and performed well for Luzern last season, and at 24 has a lot of room for development,"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 122}}, {'Speaker': 'Gray', 'Text': '"We want to help him progress, and look forward to working with him moving forward."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 77}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Hibernian say they have broken their transfer record to sign Togo international striker Thibault Klidje from Luzern.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 99}}, {'Description': 'The 24-year-old has signed a three-year deal at Easter Road, with Hibs having the option to add another year.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 101, 'EndChar': 186}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Bordeaux French forward Thibault Klidje control the ball during the French L1 football match between FC Girondins de Bordeaux and AS Saint-Etienne at the Matmut Atlantique Stadium in Bordeaux,'}]}
